4.What is the default font-size of most browsers?
A)12px
B)14px
C)16px //answrs
D)18px


✅ Correct Answer: C) 16px

Simple English:

Most web browsers use 16px as the default font size.

Example:
p {
  font-size: 16px;
}

👉 If you don't set a font size in CSS, most browsers display text at 16px.

Easy Remember:
Default browser font size = 16px
